  </table>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This function causes the script to sleep for 2.0 seconds.</li>
    <li>This script&#39;s object must be owned by the landowner or the function will silently fail.</li>
    <li>If the script&#39;s object is over group owned land, then the object must be deeded to <b>that</b> group.</li>
    <li>If the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_URL" target="_blank">PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_URL</a> value is greater than 254 characters, the command will silently fail.</li>
    <li>If using <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_URL" target="_blank">PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_URL</a> and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_AGENT" target="_blank">PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_AGENT</a>, make sure the <i>Media URL</i> in the <i>About Land ...</i> dialog is unset. See <a href="https://jira.secondlife.com/browse/SVC-4478" target="_blank">SVC-4478</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local myTexture = uuid(ll.GetTexture(0))
ll.ParcelMediaCommandList({PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_TEXTURE, myTexture, PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_PLAY})`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`key myTexture = llGetTexture(0);
llParcelMediaCommandList([PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_TEXTURE,myTexture,PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_PLAY]);`} lang="lsl" /></div>
